{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 2, "text": "作这个家庭血缘的载体，到她死亡时就终结了，因为她与其夫生育的子女，只能归入她", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 249, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "作这个家庭血缘的载体，到她死亡时就终结了，因为她与其夫生育的子女，只能归入她", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 249, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 3, "text": "丈夫的血缘系统。姑亲关系仅存血缘的直接与间接关系，没有任何财产、血缘延续等关", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 310, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "丈夫的血缘系统。姑亲关系仅存血缘的直接与间接关系，没有任何财产、血缘延续等关", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 310, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 4, "text": "系，即在一定的时限内，使家庭知道有个姑姑嫁到哪里，她有哪些子女而已。姑亲的称请", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 382, "w": 1536, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "系，即在一定的时限内，使家庭知道有个姑姑嫁到哪里，她有哪些子女而已。姑亲的称请", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 382, "w": 1536, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 5, "text": "也较简单，姑妈称“雅帕”，姑爹称“鲍帕”，表兄弟姐妹称“比隆兰”，亲家父母互称“鲍", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 439, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "也较简单，姑妈称“雅帕”，姑爹称“鲍帕”，表兄弟姐妹称“比隆兰”，亲家父母互称“鲍", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 439, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 6, "text": "弄”、“雅弄”。布依族有句广为流传的俗语：“一辈亲，二辈表，三辈四辈认不了。”用以概", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 503, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "弄”、“雅弄”。布依族有句广为流传的俗语：“一辈亲，二辈表，三辈四辈认不了。”用以概", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 503, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 7, "text": "括姑亲关系的延续时间。虽然过去有些地方出现过“亲上加亲”的姑表亲，而今在布依族", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 571, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "括姑亲关系的延续时间。虽然过去有些地方出现过“亲上加亲”的姑表亲，而今在布依族", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 571, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 8, "text": "地区已经不存在。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 640, "w": 306, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "地区已经不存在。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 640, "w": 306, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 9, "text": "姨亲关系的亲属地位比姑亲次之，关系与姑亲差异不大。姨爹姨妈互称时，姨爹称", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 700, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "姨亲关系的亲属地位比姑亲次之，关系与姑亲差异不大。姨爹姨妈互称时，姨爹称", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 700, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 10, "text": "“鲍维响”，姨妈称“雅维响”。双方子女称姨妈为“乜响”", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 764, "w": 985, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“鲍维响”，姨妈称“雅维响”。双方子女称姨妈为“乜响”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 764, "w": 985, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 11, "text": "，称姨爹为“波响”。表兄弟姐妹", "bbox_px": {"x": 1088, "y": 756, "w": 573, "h": 75}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "，称姨爹为“波响”。表兄弟姐妹", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1088, "y": 756, "w": 573, "h": 75}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 12, "text": "互称“比隆兰”", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 833, "w": 249, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "互称“比隆兰”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 833, "w": 249, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 13, "text": "。", "bbox_px": {"x": 358, "y": 853, "w": 36, "h": 32}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 358, "y": 853, "w": 36, "h": 32}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 14, "text": "外家的亲属称谓，把姑亲的亲属称谓宾主颠倒即可。另外，舅（兄）称“鲍龙”，舅", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 893, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "外家的亲属称谓，把姑亲的亲属称谓宾主颠倒即可。另外，舅（兄）称“鲍龙”，舅", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 893, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 15, "text": "（弟）称“纳”，女婿称岳父“鲍嗒”，称岳母“雅代”，外甥称外公“公代”，称外婆“奶代”", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 958, "w": 1471, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（弟）称“纳”，女婿称岳父“鲍嗒”，称岳母“雅代”，外甥称外公“公代”，称外婆“奶代”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 958, "w": 1471, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 16, "text": "继养的亲属关系除上门女婿、接纳养子外，还有招夫入赘者。招夫入赘是寡妇不愿", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1030, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "继养的亲属关系除上门女婿、接纳养子外，还有招夫入赘者。招夫入赘是寡妇不愿", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1030, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 17, "text": "离开前夫家，可招纳后夫，但后夫必须改成前夫姓氏和子辈，生育的子女归人前夫血缘，", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1094, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "离开前夫家，可招纳后夫，但后夫必须改成前夫姓氏和子辈，生育的子女归人前夫血缘，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1094, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 18, "text": "与前夫子女共享家业。招夫人赘是过去某些布依族地区存在的继养形式。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1159, "w": 1286, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "与前夫子女共享家业。招夫人赘是过去某些布依族地区存在的继养形式。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1159, "w": 1286, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 19, "text": "三、家庭道德与伦理", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1223, "w": 346, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "三、家庭道德与伦理", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1223, "w": 346, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 20, "text": "家庭道德与伦理，是家庭诞生以后维系家庭平衡运转的行为准则与规范。可以分为", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1287, "w": 1459, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家庭道德与伦理，是家庭诞生以后维系家庭平衡运转的行为准则与规范。可以分为", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1287, "w": 1459, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 21, "text": "家风（或门风）、家教（家庭教养）和家法（或家规）三大类别。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1352, "w": 1045, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家风（或门风）、家教（家庭教养）和家法（或家规）三大类别。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1352, "w": 1045, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 22, "text": "家风，是在长辈或家庭主要成员影响下，自然形成的一种潜移默化的家庭风习。布", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1416, "w": 1459, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家风，是在长辈或家庭主要成员影响下，自然形成的一种潜移默化的家庭风习。布", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1416, "w": 1459, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 23, "text": "依族的家风以民族传统美德为基础构建，所以绝大多数家风都有统一的风貌。首先就是", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1481, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "依族的家风以民族传统美德为基础构建，所以绝大多数家风都有统一的风貌。首先就是", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1481, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 24, "text": "尊老爱幼。尊老有对家庭长辈的尊敬和对同辈年长者的尊敬。对长者的训导不论对错，", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1545, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "尊老爱幼。尊老有对家庭长辈的尊敬和对同辈年长者的尊敬。对长者的训导不论对错，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1545, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 25, "text": "不准顶撞，不准还口，有时长者动手打耳光或敲烟杆斗也不准表示反抗，做到“有则改之，", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1609, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不准顶撞，不准还口，有时长者动手打耳光或敲烟杆斗也不准表示反抗，做到“有则改之，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1609, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 26, "text": "无则加勉”。对长者的不足之处，不准直接对长者言明，只能通过他们的同辈转告。平时", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1674, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "无则加勉”。对长者的不足之处，不准直接对长者言明，只能通过他们的同辈转告。平时", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1674, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 27, "text": "吃饭让最老的长辈坐上席（神龛下），先给老人挟好菜，主动给老人添饭。有什么好吃的", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1742, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "吃饭让最老的长辈坐上席（神龛下），先给老人挟好菜，主动给老人添饭。有什么好吃的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1742, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 28, "text": "先给老人享受。在老人面前不准跷二郎腿，不准开玩笑；不准面对着老人洗脚；与老人交", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1806, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "先给老人享受。在老人面前不准跷二郎腿，不准开玩笑；不准面对着老人洗脚；与老人交", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1806, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 29, "text": "谈时不准指手画脚，轮到小辈说话时，先尊称对方才叙述内容。与长辈一起劳动时抢最", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1871, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "谈时不准指手画脚，轮到小辈说话时，先尊称对方才叙述内容。与长辈一起劳动时抢最", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1871, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 30, "text": "重最难的活做。老人到五十岁后一般不给做犁田、扛挞斗、挑担等重活。老人到了六十", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1935, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "重最难的活做。老人到五十岁后一般不给做犁田、扛挞斗、挑担等重活。老人到了六十", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1935, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 31, "text": "岁后，一般不给做野外活路，否则被耻笑为不孝。了老人有个幸福的晚年，布依族小辈", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2000, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "岁后，一般不给做野外活路，否则被耻笑为不孝。了老人有个幸福的晚年，布依族小辈", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2000, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 32, "text": "不论有什么争吵，或生活中碰到什么不顺心的烦恼，一般都尽可能地不让老人知道，以免", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2064, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不论有什么争吵，或生活中碰到什么不顺心的烦恼，一般都尽可能地不让老人知道，以免", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2064, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 171, "line_no": 33, "text": "增加他们的思想负担。平时再困难，也要给老人买几件新衣服；买酒给他们喝，保证他们", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2128, "w": 1540, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "增加他们的思想负担。平时再困难，也要给老人买几件新衣服；买酒给他们喝，保证他们", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2128, "w": 1540, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
